[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3035177312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108080#issuecomment-3035177312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108080","id":3035177312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc606SFg","user":{"login":"Gaktan","id":1674095,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzQwOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1674095?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan","html_url":"https://github.com/Gaktan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T09:29:10Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T09:31:45Z","body":"I did some more tests, and its not an issue of passing INF arguments. If the distance between the two points are too large, this will cause an integer overflow, on top of attempting to allocate a 16GiB position vector.\r\n\r\nThe crash can still occur even if parameters are \"sane\".\r\n\r\nI don't know what the policy on memory allocation is for Godot, but I think limiting the maximum amount of memory allocated for a debug draw is a sensible thing to do.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3035177312/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3506836252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108080#issuecomment-3506836252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108080","id":3506836252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RBhMc","user":{"login":"Gaktan","id":1674095,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzQwOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1674095?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan","html_url":"https://github.com/Gaktan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-08T19:53:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-11T10:30:06Z","body":"Bumping this. There is no way to prevent an integer overflow and out of memory issues without some kind of arbitrary limitation.\r\n\r\nWhat you say about breaking existing projects is true, which is why there is a warning to let users know.\r\n\r\nAlso, this code for drawing a 2D dashed line. Depending on your resolution it might never even be possible to display more than a certain amount of dashes to begin with.\r\n\r\nMaybe an alternative could be to clip the lines to the screen border?\r\nEdit: Clipping the lines does not fix all cases, if the dash size is extremely small, it may still create a lot of dashes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3506836252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]